\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Brazil Real Slightly Stronger Ahead of Futures Expiry\b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 2013\par 15:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--The Brazilian real was slightly stronger in early trading Monday ahead of the expiry of monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures contracts.\par \par \uc2 The real was trading at BRL2.2505 to the dollar, stronger against the Friday close of BRL2.2555, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 "It's all about the futures expiry today," said Vanderlei Muniz, partner in southern Brazil's Onnix brokerage. "Holders of long positions are fighting it out with holders of short positions."\par \par \uc2 Monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures contracts expire Tuesday. They will close out based on Monday's average \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate, or Ptax rate.\par \par \uc2 Expiry of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures contracts typically brings high volume to Brazil's spot market as holders of short-dollar positions battle with holders of long positions to influence the Ptax rate.\par \par \uc2 Fundamentals are likely to return as the main market influence Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Traders said worries about a looming U.S. budget crisis could bring volatility to trading starting Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue it policy of daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an effort to maintain orderly trading. Later Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will auction the equivalent of $500 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts. The contracts allow investors to exchange bonds linked to domestic interest rates for paper indexed directly to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 Write to Tom Murphy at tom.murphy@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 September 30, 2013 09:00 ET (13:00 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130930e99u002mo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
