\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Tombini:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Markets To Continue\b0\par\par\uc2 By Paulo Trevisani   \par \uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 2013\par 17:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will keep its actions on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets as planned to help the economy transition to when the U.S. stops flooding markets with dollars.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Federal Reserve "has just postponed" the reversal of its easy-money policy, \uc2 Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President \uc2 Alexandre Tombini\uc2  said during Senate testimony Tuesday. The reversal "will happen sometime in the future," he said.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, has been very much influenced by Fed policies in the past few years.\par \par \uc2 Fed actions aimed at jump-starting the U.S. economy caused larger-than-usual availability of dollars in global market. That made the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lose value against the real and made Brazilian exports less competitive.\par \par \uc2 But signs that the Fed was about to bring the easy-money policy to an end sent the real into a tailspin in the last few months, forcing \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to start a program of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to put a floor under the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mr. Tombini said the program will remain in place, even after the Fed's decision last week to keep in place the bond-buying program that has injected dollars in global markets.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to act to reduce volatility," Mr. Tombini said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Paulo Trevisani at paulo.trevisani@wsj.com [ 24-09-13 1613GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130924e99o000j3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
