\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real Closes Stronger on  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Overseas Data\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jeff Fick   \par \uc2 503 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 2013\par 21:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real closed stronger against the U.S. dollar Monday as \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and positive economic data from overseas lifted the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The real exited active trading at BRL2.3696 per U.S. dollar, stronger from Friday's closing price fix of BRL2.3824, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was boosted at the session's start by better-than-expected manufacturing data from China, Brazil's largest trade partner and an important consumer of commodities such as iron ore and soy. Global tensions surrounding Syria also eased, as U.S. President Barack Obama said that he would seek congressional approval before punishing Syria for alleged chemical weapons attacks.\par \par \uc2 The real strengthened further after the \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out two successful sales of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps. The bank sold all of the 30,000 contracts on offer equivalent to $1.49 billion. The bank held its regularly scheduled auction of $500 million in swaps as part of the $60 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program through the end of 2013. A second auction of $1 billion in swaps was announced Friday to calm volatile \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.\par \par \uc2 Late Monday, the bank said that it would sell 10,000 swaps valued at $500 million in a regularly scheduled auction.\par \par \uc2 The swap auctions offer investors the opportunity to exchange bonds linked to domestic interest rates for paper indexed directly to the U.S. dollar. The auctions typically help the real strengthen against the greenback by giving investors more options for hedging in the dollar.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has calmed down the market," said Marcos Trabbold, chief of trading \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Sao Paulo's B&T Associados. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's program of planned \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has made the bank's strategy "perfectly clear" to the market, rinsing some of the pressure on the real from speculators out of the market, Mr. Trabbold added.\par \par \uc2 While Brazil's predictability will help companies and investors in need of hedging or liquidity, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will still likely see some volatility until the U.S. Federal Reserve gives a clearer picture of U.S. monetary policy, Mr. Trabbold said. Uncertainty about when the Fed will start to taper its bond purchases has caused many investors to bail out of emerging-market investments such as Brazil.\par \par \uc2 Despite market uncertainty, dollars continue to flow into Brazil and will keep the \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  from using the $375 billion in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to back up the real, Mr. Trabbold added.\par \par \uc2 "Only if the [\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ] starts to feel some distortion in the market, such as net outflows, it could sell dollars into the market," the trader said.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trabbold still sees some space for the real to gain more ground on the greenback, perhaps strengthening to about BRL2.30 per dollar in the medium term.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jeff Fick at Jeff.Fick@wsj.com [ 02-09-13 1926GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130902e992000ki\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
