\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Real Opens Weaker Wednesday On Syria Concerns\b0\par\par\uc2 By Luciana Magalhaes   \par \uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 2013\par 15:20\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--Brazil's real weakened slightly against the dollar Wednesday as the prospect of Western military action against Syria continues to weigh on the markets.\par \par \uc2 The real was trading at BRL2.3667 to the dollar, after closing at BRL2.3652 to the dollar Tuesday, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 The possibility of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Syria heightened investor caution in emerging markets like \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , adding to concerns related to the expected monetary policy tightening by the U.S. Federal Reserve.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's real has weakened by about 20% so far this year as investors shift their portfolios to position for the possibility of improving returns abroad.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's continued market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  also are helping stanch the big losses that the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had seen in previous sessions. The bank has been rolling over expiring \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps in order to meet demand for dollars, and as a result slow the real's decline against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 The contracts are part of some $60 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  scheduled for offer by Dec. 31.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts allow investors to exchange bonds indexed to domestic interest rates for paper tied directly to the U.S. dollar. The swap auctions typically lead to a weakening of the U.S. dollar and a strengthening of the Brazilian real.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also said it may carry out additional \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  beyond its regularly scheduled auctions if it sees the need.\par \par \uc2 Write to Luciana Magalhaes at luciana.magalhaes@dowjones.com [ 28-08-13 1320GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130828e98s000if\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
