 eases 1.5. (kevin.kingsbury@wsj.com)\par \par \uc2 To contact the Market Talk Editors,\par \par \uc2 Bradley Davis, 212 416-2654, bradley.davis@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Kevin Kingsbury, 212 416-2354, kevin.kingsbury@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 John Shipman, 212 416-2181,john.shipman@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Patrick Sullivan, 212 416-2326,Patrick.sullivan@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 August 23, 2013 06:14 ET (10:14 GMT)\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 23-08-13 1026GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNWK00020130823e98n0000t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
