\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging-Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Recover as U.S. Data Disappoint\b0\par\par\uc2 By Lauren Davidson   \par \uc2 575 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 August 2013\par 20:09\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The Indian rupee gained against the dollar as weaker-than-expected U.S. housing data and a spate of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  boosted emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  around the globe.\par \par \uc2 The dollar fell 0.8% against the rupee, trading recently at INR63.96, according to CQG data, ending a string of consecutive record lows for India's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Disappointing housing data out of the U.S. bolstered emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as the weaker-than-expected figures increased traders' uncertainty about when the Federal Reserve will start to wind down its bond-buying program. The stimulus has injected cheap money into the economy and driven investors toward high-yielding emerging-market assets.\par \par \uc2 Sales of newly built homes in the U.S. hit a nine-month low, falling 13.4% in July and increasing concerns that higher mortgage rates will hurt the housing recovery.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real gained the most among emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , additionally bolstered by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Late Thursday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unveiled a $60 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program designed to stem the rapid decline of the real, which has lost about 15% to the greenback this year. The bank will offer $3 billion of dollar loans and swaps per week through Dec. 31, adding to the some $45 billion it has sold in dollar swap contracts so far this year.\par \par \uc2 The dollar fell 2.8% against the real, trading recently at BRL2.3667.\par \par \uc2 "This better-than-expected plan, selling dollars via an automatic system, helps to restore [market] confidence [because] it's consistent and predictable," said Maya Hernandez, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 HSBC\uc2  in New York. The planned daily auctions mark a change from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's more erratic previous \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , so they have the potential to be more meaningful in boosting the real over time, Ms. Hernandez said.\par \par \uc2 "Regulation has not been a forte of Brazil's government, and asset prices have shown that," she said. "This mechanism is much more market friendly than what we've had so far. It speaks very well for the government--this is a shift in the right direction."\par \par \uc2 The real gained on the back of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's announcement, despite news Friday that Brazil's current-account deficit widened in July to $9.02 billion from $3.95 billion in June, due to increasing imports.\par \par \uc2 The dollar also declined against other Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , falling 0.7% to buy the Mexican peso at MXN12.9979 and 0.6% against the Chilean peso to trade at CLP509.50.\par \par \uc2 The dollar fell 0.6% against the South African rand to buy ZAR10.2167. The Indonesian rupiah climbed 1.3% to the greenback, which recently bought IDR10891.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Turkish lira slid against the dollar, which bought a record TRY2.0 as Turkey's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to suffer from the recent foreign investment exodus, despite continued \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures.\par \par \uc2 --Matthew Cowley contributed to this article\par \par \uc2 Write to Lauren Davidson at lauren.davidson@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Corrections & Amplifications\par \par \uc2 This item was corrected at 2:54 p.m. EDT to show that the price of the Brazilian real as BRL2.3667. The original incorrectly stated BRL23667. [ 23-08-13 1809GMT ]\par \par \uc2 "Emerging-Market \b \highlight22\uc2 Currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  Recover as U.S. Data Disappoint," published at 2:09 p.m. EDT, misstated the price of the Brazilian real as BRL23667. The correct quote was BRL2.3667. [ 23-08-13 1853GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130823e98n000iw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
