\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ \uc2 Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Hold Scheduled  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Auctions To Offer Hedge To Market\b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 August 2013\par 23:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 22 Aug 2013 17:52 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Will Hold Regular Swap, Repo Auctions Through Dec 31\par \par \uc2 22 Aug 2013 17:54 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  To Offer $500 Mln Per Day At Swap Auctions Mon Through Thurs\par \par \uc2 22 Aug 2013 17:56 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  To Offer $1 Bln Credit Line At Repo Auctions On Fridays\par \par \uc2 22 Aug 2013 17:58 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Will Take Additional \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market Actions If Needed\par \par \uc2 22 Aug 2013 18:19 EDT DJ  \uc2 Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to Hold Regular \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Auctions to Offer Hedge\par \par \uc2 BRASILIA--\uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will hold regularly scheduled auctions of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps and credit line repurchases in order to offer hedge and liquidity to the local market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it will hold regular auctions beginning Friday and extending through Dec. 31.\par \par \uc2 The institution said it would schedule daily swap auctions of up to $500 million on Monday through Thursday of each week and dollar repurchase auctions of up to $1 billion every Friday.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it would also take additional actions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market "if necessary."\par \par \uc2 Brazil has been holding frequent unscheduled swap and repurchase auctions over recent months in an effort to curb unusually heavy volatility in the exchange market prompted by repositioning of emerging market investors in anticipation of possible changes in U.S. monetary policy.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  last held regularly scheduled market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2002 amid investor uncertainties ahead of local elections during that year.\par \par \uc2 Write to Gerald Jeffris at gerald.jeffris@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -0- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 August 22, 2013 18:19 ET (22:19 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130822e98m00fuj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
