id Monday in a statement.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The interbank deposit rate futures contract settling January 2014 rose 0.11 percentage point Monday to 9.29%.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The statement, which was posted on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's website, came after the real weakened to a new four-year low against the dollar Monday, even after the bank held three \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swap auctions and announced another auction Tuesday morning as it tries to manage the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's depreciation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is paying close attention to developments in Brazil's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market and will continue to offer \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hedge options and, if necessary, liquidity to segments of the market that need it, the statement said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Tombini reiterated that the exchange rate can move in either direction and warned market participants against betting too much on moves in one direction.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Jeffrey T. Lewis at Jeffrey.lewis@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 August 19, 2013 18:19 ET (22:19 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130819e98j005lb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
