terest rates for paper linked directly to the U.S. dollar. Typically, the swap auctions lead to a weakening of the U.S. dollar and a strengthening of the Brazilian real.\par \par \uc2 Write to Gerald Jeffris at gerald.jeffris@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 August 15, 2013 19:36 ET (23:36 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130815e98f005z0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
