hip.\par \par \uc2 Jinko Solar\uc2  ( JKS) rose 5.7% to $14.58 after winning a contract for a solar project in Indiana.\par \par \uc2 Ambev ( ABV) gain 4.8% to $37.78 after reporting higher profits once derivative expenses were subtracted.\par \par \uc2 MagnaChip ( MX) gained 18% to $20.56 after beating earnings and getting upgraded. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  For continuously updated news from Barron's, see Barrons.com at \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://barrons.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://barrons.com}}}\uc2 \f2 . \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 July 31, 2013 16:45 ET (20:45 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130731e97v0065l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
