\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Finance Minister:  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Depreciation a Global Phenomenon\b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juli 2013\par 22:15\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA--Brazil's government sees the recent sharp depreciation of the Brazilian real as part of the global trend toward a stronger U.S. dollar, Finance Minister Guido Mantega said Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 "We're all in the same boat," he told reporters at an impromptu news conference. "Other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have also depreciated against the dollar. The stronger dollar is an international trend."\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real suffered more losses Wednesday, closing at BRL2.2655 to the dollar, its lowest level against the American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in more than four years.\par \par \uc2 The real has lost more than 10% of its value against the dollar since the beginning of the year, with most of the losses occurring in the last month.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar has been rising against most emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent weeks on expectations that the U.S. Federal Reserve Board will begin a gradual retreat from its monetary loosening policy later this year. The gradual shift away from easy money will lead to higher U.S. interest rates and declining international investments in emerging market countries, according to economists.\par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Mantega said "Investors have exaggerated somewhat. They are trying to get ahead of the Fed's decisions."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Mantega declined to comment on government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently in recent weeks in efforts to stem the often steep depreciation of the real against the dollar. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have emphasized that such \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are designed to dampen market volatility and not to force the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in one direction or the other.\par \par \uc2 --Bruno Lourenco in Brasilia contributed to this article\par \par \uc2 Write to Tom Murphy at tom.murphy@dowjones.com [ 03-07-13 2036GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130703e973000ox\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
